  'What lessons from Noli Me Tangere and El Filibusterismo remain relevant in Philippine society today?',
  'Which character do I recognise in myself or in someone I know, and what does that tell me?',
  'Padre Florentino asks where the youth are who will give their golden hours to their country. What is my answer?'
